# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 08

## Topic
# Relative Pronouns & Relative Adverbs
### (Whom / Where / When)

---

## 1. Whom

**Whom** is used for **people** who receive the action.
(목적격 관계대명사)

Example

The customer whom I helped was very kind.

The man whom we met yesterday is a doctor.

※ 회화에서는 whom 대신 who를 사용하는 경우도 많다.

---

## 2. Where

Used for **places**.

Example

This is the restaurant where we had dinner.

The office where I work is in Seoul.

---

## 3. When

Used for **time**.

Example

I remember the day when we first met.

Do you remember the time when we studied together?

---

## Remember

| Word | Used For |
|------|----------|
| who | 사람 (주격) |
| whom | 사람 (목적격) |
| which | 사물 |
| where | 장소 |
| when | 시간 |

---

## TOEIC Tip

✔ where → 장소

✔ when → 시간

✔ whom → 목적격

선행사가 **장소인지, 시간인지, 사람인지** 먼저 확인하자.
